    eleventh = '<section id="eleventh-pass"><h2>Color backing isolated; observed tags captured</h2><p>Eight single-buffer probes showed the external-display shift before video encoding, in both BGRA and NV12. An explicit 709 matrix and sRGB conversion did not repair it. Actual display-profile transforms closely matched the shifted primaries. Changing only the owned fixture’s backing store to declared sRGB restored its references within one channel value.</p><p>Candidate <code>' + html.escape(summary11['loaded_build']) + '</code> now records actual pixel-format and color-tag boundaries. Source metadata keeps requested sRGB separate from observed tags; missing values remain unknown. Ten mechanical checks and actual MCP readback passed.</p><p><strong>The declared-backing recording passed:</strong> 229 exact muxed/source timestamps, three external/Retina/external geometry segments, no encoder or journal loss, and 18 sampled colors within two channel values. Its 230-frame software preview reproduced all 18 source RGB values exactly.</p><div class="pair">'
